{
  "hero": "<img class=\"health-opening-image\" src=\"https://iamshruthi.com/assets/media/f7838007f7995ab994df.webp\" width=\"1536\" height=\"1024\" alt=\"Harmony Sync cover showing the portrait karaoke tablet interface\">",
  "subtitle": "<h2 class=\"subtitle\">A shared karaoke tablet that helps groups set the room vibe and see who’s up next.</h2>",
  "about": "<div class=\"content-align-right\"><div class=\"copy-block\"><h3 class=\"eyebrow\">about</h3><p class=\"body-copy-large\">Harmony Sync is a family-friendly private karaoke concept designed across a phone, room tablet and shared display. I designed the tablet experience in our team project, from wireframes and room controls to the final prototype and heuristic evaluation.</p></div></div>",
  "labels": [
    "userflows",
    "wireframes",
    "design system"
  ],
  "body": "<style>\n.harmony-section figure{margin:0;min-width:0;height:100%}\n.harmony-screens{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:var(--case-panel-gap,10px);width:100%}\n.harmony-section .harmony-screen{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;padding:clamp(8px,1.4vw,18px);background:var(--case-panel-background,#eae7df);border-radius:var(--case-media-radius,10px)}\n.harmony-screen a{display:block}\n.harmony-screen img{display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;margin-inline:auto;border-radius:6px}\n.harmony-screen figcaption{margin:0!important;padding:0!important;color:var(--ink)!important}\n.harmony-detail{margin:0;padding:20px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line);width:100%}\n.harmony-detail h3{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:clamp(17px,2vw,24px)}\n.harmony-detail p{margin:0}\n.harmony-flow{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(6,minmax(0,1fr));gap:8px;padding:0;list-style:none;width:100%;margin:0}\n.harmony-flow li{padding:12px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}\n.harmony-system{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:16px;width:100%;align-items:start}\n.harmony-system a{display:block}\n@media(max-width:700px){.harmony-screens{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.harmony-system{grid-template-columns:1fr}.harmony-flow{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}}\n</style><section class=\"content-align-left\">\n      <div class=\"content-section harmony-section\">\n        <div class=\"section-copy-wrap\">\n          <h2 class=\"display-medium\"><span class=\"display-medium-alt_wrap\">01</span>userflows</h2>\n          <div class=\"caption\"><p class=\"body-copy-small\">The tablet guides the group from joining the room to handing the mic to the next singer. A QR code or manual table code connects the devices, and the queue and room status update across them.</p></div>\n        </div>\n        <ol class=\"harmony-flow body-copy-small\">\n<li>Connect the room</li><li>See how the devices work together</li><li>Set the vibe</li><li>Get ready</li><li>Perform</li><li>Celebrate and hand over</li>\n</ol><div class=\"harmony-screens\"><figure class=\"health-panel harmony-screen\">\n      <a href=\"https://iamshruthi.com/assets/harmony-sync/welcome-detail.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"Open full-size image: Connect the room\"><img src=\"https://iamshruthi.com/assets/harmony-sync/welcome-detail.webp\" width=\"766\" height=\"1100\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Tablet welcome screen with a QR code and a manual table-code field\"></a>\n      <figcaption class=\"health-panel-title\">Connect the room</figcaption>\n    </figure><figure class=\"health-panel harmony-screen\">\n      <a href=\"https://iamshruthi.com/assets/harmony-sync/vibe-detail.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"Open full-size image: See how the devices work together\"><img src=\"https://iamshruthi.com/assets/harmony-sync/vibe-detail.webp\" width=\"769\" height=\"1100\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Guidance overlay explaining how the three devices work together\"></a>\n      <figcaption class=\"health-panel-title\">See how the devices work together</figcaption>\n    </figure><figure class=\"health-panel harmony-screen\">\n      <a href=\"https://iamshruthi.com/assets/harmony-sync/vibe-settings-detail.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"Open full-size image: Set the vibe\"><img src=\"https://iamshruthi.com/assets/harmony-sync/vibe-settings-detail.webp\" width=\"769\" height=\"1100\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Vibe presets and room lighting, volume, and effects controls\"></a>\n      <figcaption class=\"health-panel-title\">Set the vibe</figcaption>\n    </figure><figure class=\"health-panel harmony-screen\">\n      <a href=\"https://iamshruthi.com/assets/harmony-sync/ready-clean.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"Open full-size image: Get ready\"><img src=\"https://iamshruthi.com/assets/harmony-sync/ready-clean.webp\" width=\"203\" height=\"400\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Next singer countdown, queue position, and readiness controls\"></a>\n      <figcaption class=\"health-panel-title\">Get ready</figcaption>\n    </figure><figure class=\"health-panel harmony-screen\">\n      <a href=\"https://iamshruthi.com/assets/harmony-sync/performance-detail.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"Open full-size image: Perform\"><img src=\"https://iamshruthi.com/assets/harmony-sync/performance-detail.webp\" width=\"769\" height=\"1100\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Live performance screen with playback, microphone and audience reaction controls\"></a>\n      <figcaption class=\"health-panel-title\">Perform</figcaption>\n    </figure><figure class=\"health-panel harmony-screen\">\n      <a href=\"https://iamshruthi.com/assets/harmony-sync/celebrate-detail.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"Open full-size image: Great Performance\"><img src=\"https://iamshruthi.com/assets/harmony-sync/celebrate-detail.webp\" width=\"769\" height=\"1100\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Celebration screen that names the next singer\"></a>\n      <figcaption class=\"health-panel-title\">Hand over · Great Performance</figcaption>\n    </figure><figure class=\"health-panel harmony-screen\">\n      <a href=\"https://iamshruthi.com/assets/harmony-sync/handover-encouragement.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"Open full-size image: Hand over · Nice Effort\">\n        <img src=\"https://iamshruthi.com/assets/harmony-sync/handover-encouragement.webp\" width=\"224\" height=\"320\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Nice Effort message and a preview of the next singer\">\n      </a>\n      <figcaption class=\"health-panel-title\">Hand over · Nice Effort</figcaption>\n    </figure></div>\n<div class=\"harmony-detail\"><h3>How the devices work together</h3><p class=\"body-copy-small\">Guests browse and queue songs on their phones. The shared display makes lyrics and the next singer visible to the room, while the tablet handles room settings, performer readiness and audience reactions. After a song, the tablet can show either celebration or encouragement before handing over.</p></div>\n<div class=\"harmony-screens\"><figure class=\"health-panel harmony-screen\">\n      <a href=\"https://iamshruthi.com/assets/harmony-sync/phone-song-browse.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"Open full-size image: Phone · Browse songs\">\n        <img src=\"https://iamshruthi.com/assets/harmony-sync/phone-song-browse.webp\" width=\"322\" height=\"700\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Personal song browsing with genre filters, search and recommendations\">\n      </a>\n      <figcaption class=\"health-panel-title\">Phone · Browse songs</figcaption>\n    </figure><figure class=\"health-panel harmony-screen\">\n      <a href=\"https://iamshruthi.com/assets/harmony-sync/shared-display.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"Open full-size image: Shared display · See who’s next\">\n        <img src=\"https://iamshruthi.com/assets/harmony-sync/shared-display.webp\" width=\"768\" height=\"426\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Shared karaoke display showing the next singer and audience reactions\">\n      </a>\n      <figcaption class=\"health-panel-title\">Shared display · See who’s next</figcaption>\n    </figure></div>\n      </div>\n    </section><section class=\"content-align-left\">\n      <div class=\"content-section harmony-section\">\n        <div class=\"section-copy-wrap\">\n          <h2 class=\"display-medium\"><span class=\"display-medium-alt_wrap\">02</span>wireframes</h2>\n          <div class=\"caption\"><p class=\"body-copy-small\">The tablet went through four Figma iterations. Feedback highlighted unclear onboarding, too many similar settings icons and uncertainty about who would sing next.</p></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"harmony-screens\"><figure class=\"health-panel harmony-screen\">\n      <a href=\"https://iamshruthi.com/assets/harmony-sync/low-detail.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"Open full-size image: 01 · Low fidelity\"><img src=\"https://iamshruthi.com/assets/harmony-sync/low-detail.webp\" width=\"769\" height=\"1100\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Early wireframe for choosing a room vibe\"></a>\n      <figcaption class=\"health-panel-title\">01 · Low fidelity</figcaption>\n    </figure><figure class=\"health-panel harmony-screen\">\n      <a href=\"https://iamshruthi.com/assets/harmony-sync/mid-detail.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"Open full-size image: 02 · Mid fidelity\"><img src=\"https://iamshruthi.com/assets/harmony-sync/mid-detail.webp\" width=\"769\" height=\"1100\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Iteration with illustrated Party, Chill and Neon presets\"></a>\n      <figcaption class=\"health-panel-title\">02 · Mid fidelity</figcaption>\n    </figure><figure class=\"health-panel harmony-screen\">\n      <a href=\"https://iamshruthi.com/assets/harmony-sync/vibe-settings-detail.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"Open full-size image: 03 · Final ambience controls\">\n        <img src=\"https://iamshruthi.com/assets/harmony-sync/vibe-settings-detail.webp\" width=\"769\" height=\"1100\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Final dark tablet screen with three distinct vibe presets and labelled room controls\">\n      </a>\n      <figcaption class=\"health-panel-title\">03 · Final ambience controls</figcaption>\n    </figure></div>\n<div class=\"harmony-detail\"><h3>Make the handover clearer</h3><p class=\"body-copy-small\">Five participants reviewed the tablet against Nielsen’s usability heuristics. The review found six severity-1 issues and four severity-2 issues, including unclear queue position, performer readiness and onboarding. I added a position-in-queue panel, an “I’m Ready” action and a short guide explaining the role of each device.</p></div>\n<div class=\"harmony-detail\"><h3>Separate the main controls</h3><p class=\"body-copy-small\">Design feedback prompted a visible manual table-code field, a consistent Home button and fewer settings icons. I also moved the key control closer to its label and made song and singer information easier to distinguish.</p></div>\n      </div>\n    </section><section class=\"content-align-left\">\n      <div class=\"content-section harmony-section\">\n        <div class=\"section-copy-wrap\">\n          <h2 class=\"display-medium\"><span class=\"display-medium-alt_wrap\">03</span>design system</h2>\n          <div class=\"caption\"><p class=\"body-copy-small\">The Figma design system defines the colour tokens, type styles and reusable controls behind the tablet interface. Orange draws attention to key actions in a low-light karaoke room.</p></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"harmony-system\">\n<figure class=\"health-panel harmony-screen\">\n      <a href=\"https://iamshruthi.com/assets/harmony-sync/system-colours.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"Open full-size Figma export for colour primitives and tokens\">\n        <img src=\"https://iamshruthi.com/assets/harmony-sync/system-colours.webp\" width=\"1641\" height=\"1900\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Figma board showing black, blue, brown, green, orange, yellow and white colour scales with semantic tokens below\">\n      </a>\n      <figcaption class=\"health-panel-title\">Colour primitives and tokens</figcaption>\n    </figure>\n<figure class=\"health-panel harmony-screen\">\n      <a href=\"https://iamshruthi.com/assets/harmony-sync/system-typography.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"Open full-size Figma export for typography\">\n        <img src=\"https://iamshruthi.com/assets/harmony-sync/system-typography.webp\" width=\"1302\" height=\"1800\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Figma typography board showing heading, caption and body styles at multiple sizes\">\n      </a>\n      <figcaption class=\"health-panel-title\">Typography</figcaption>\n    </figure>\n<figure class=\"health-panel harmony-screen\">\n      <a href=\"https://iamshruthi.com/assets/harmony-sync/system-buttons.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"Open full-size Figma export for buttons and controls\">\n        <img src=\"https://iamshruthi.com/assets/harmony-sync/system-buttons.webp\" width=\"1702\" height=\"1074\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Button sizes with default, hover, focus and disabled states, plus echo dropdown controls\">\n      </a>\n      <figcaption class=\"health-panel-title\">Buttons and controls</figcaption>\n    </figure>\n<figure class=\"health-panel harmony-screen\">\n      <a href=\"https://iamshruthi.com/assets/harmony-sync/system-cards.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"Open full-size Figma export for cards and containers\">\n        <img src=\"https://iamshruthi.com/assets/harmony-sync/system-cards.webp\" width=\"1784\" height=\"1120\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Card state variants, an Up Next container and microphone controls\">\n      </a>\n      <figcaption class=\"health-panel-title\">Cards and containers</figcaption>\n    </figure>\n</div>\n<div class=\"harmony-system\"><figure class=\"health-panel harmony-screen\">\n      <a href=\"https://iamshruthi.com/assets/harmony-sync/system-icons.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"Open full-size image: Navigation and control icons\">\n        <img src=\"https://iamshruthi.com/assets/harmony-sync/system-icons.webp\" width=\"821\" height=\"375\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Ten Harmony Sync icons including home, menu, microphone, audio, and lighting\">\n      </a>\n      <figcaption class=\"health-panel-title\">Navigation and control icons</figcaption>\n    </figure><figure class=\"health-panel harmony-screen\">\n      <a href=\"https://iamshruthi.com/assets/harmony-sync/system-avatar-detail.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"Open full-size image: Singer avatar\">\n        <img src=\"https://iamshruthi.com/assets/harmony-sync/system-avatar-detail.webp\" width=\"362\" height=\"330\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Illustrated Harmony Sync singer avatar with a blue circular border\">\n      </a>\n      <figcaption class=\"health-panel-title\">Singer avatar</figcaption>\n    </figure></div>\n<div class=\"harmony-detail\"><h3>What the system carries across screens</h3><p class=\"body-copy-small\">Vibe cards, countdowns and labelled audio controls give each stage a recognisable structure. Clearer primary and secondary actions help people distinguish the next step from optional controls.</p></div>\n      </div>\n    </section>"
}
